    story: Ana Wildcock was born in a bell tower birth, where bells, chores, and
      ritual discipline marked the first memories. As a child, Ana Wildcock lived
      through a festival bell duty, learning ritual calm, chores, fasting, and the
      value of repetition. As a young adult, Ana Wildcock worked through a shield
      line soldier, turning drills, fear, formation work, and orders into practical
      violence. They enter the dojo to win coin without taking orders.
